{"filename": "semanoor-sample.html", "markdown": "# Discovering solar energy\n\nSemanoor Document Studio - demonstration lesson\n\n## 1. Start with a question\n\nHow can sunlight help power a classroom? Solar panels turn energy from sunlight into electricity. The amount produced depends on sunlight, panel size and other conditions.\n\n## 2. Explore the parts\n\n| Part        | What it does                                    |\n|-------------|-------------------------------------------------|\n| Solar panel | Converts sunlight into electricity              |\n| Inverter    | Changes direct current into alternating current |\n| Battery     | Stores energy for later use                     |\n\n## 3. Think and discuss\n\n- What changes when clouds cover the sun?\n- Where could a school place its panels?\n- Why might a battery be useful after sunset?\n\n## ٤. اكتشف الطاقة الشمسية\n\nتحوّل الألواح الشمسية طاقة ضوء الشمس إلى كهرباء. فكّر في الأماكن المناسبة لوضع الألواح في مدرستك، ثم ناقش أفكارك مع زملائك.\n\n## Learning objective\n\nExplain the roles of a solar panel, inverter and battery using a simple classroom example.", "document": {"schema_name": "DoclingDocument", "version": "1.10.0", "name": "semanoor-sample", "origin": {"mimetype": "text/html", "binary_hash": 5133131280838579168, "filename": "document.html"}, "furniture": {"self_ref": "#/furniture", "children": [], "content_layer": "furniture", "name": "_root_", "label": "unspecified"}, "body": {"self_ref": "#/body", "children": [{"$ref": "#/texts/0"}, {"$ref": "#/texts/1"}], "content_layer": "body", "name": "_root_", "label": "unspecified"}, "groups": [{"self_ref": "#/groups/0", "parent": {"$ref": "#/texts/6"}, "children": [{"$ref": "#/texts/7"}, {"$ref": "#/texts/8"}, {"$ref": "#/texts/9"}], "content_layer": "body", "name": "list", "label": "list"}], "texts": [{"self_ref": "#/texts/0", "parent": {"$ref": "#/body"}, "children": [], "content_layer": "furniture", "label": "title", "prov": [], "orig": "Discovering 